rname{arccos}⁡(x):$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13996467/assets/9dcc5a116c2a564547283783a7df7b1cd3a9ab3b76ac24dc2695c4cb367796d5.png)\n\nThe domain of $\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(x)$ is $x\\in [-1,1].$ Since $\\frac{3}{2}\\notin [-1,1],$ this means that $\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{3}{2})$ is undefined.\n\nTherefore, our limit is undefined, too." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-152761/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7f458c61-bc51-5653-9ecb-1e96eb5c335e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-152761"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-152806/selection/d6f27b7c7939a102723fed67409856455f84c69bf3e5c2599003ca6bf26244df" :answer/id #uuid "869f78b8-3248-5a18-ad73-a7ab0e1a85d3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Undefined" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152806/selection/986e06f062dcc0ad37fbb185f7e0d56b0fd8e74b571035e7dc0af3d06af89951" :answer/id #uuid "a1c0c578-73de-567b-8c16-f60ae47f1f73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152806/selection/19dc865f9e5e3c737c66357f8fadabd198054c3b810769ac94279915b38d6a76" :answer/id #uuid "1ba3568b-28c4-5f11-a150-4bdbc80c45af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152806/selection/f6cd7ad815cbceebfe1cddfb3219edf7d8bce0273da1c741fc6acf433fc7d1c8" :answer/id #uuid "dd9c4f12-0908-5c52-a26b-d011d1ba781f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\pi }^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152806/selection/7b1b8538b264eef6681d0ab5f3b14d51b6cdff67f34fba59d0886ae5c6acf80a" :answer/id #uuid "07756689-fa59-582e-b7d1-e710c27f93de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-152806/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "cd8a9876-8b94-545e-9df8-3cbbe2dbb301" :answer-field/ke